  "description": "USLege connects Claude to the USLege legislative intelligence platform, giving you real-time access to legislative data across U.S. state legislatures.\n\nSearch and read bills, votes, committee activity, statutes, executive orders, and the state register directly from Claude. Look up legislators, lobbyists and their clients, hearing witnesses, and testimony. Pull bill documents, vote records, and committee calendars without leaving the conversation.\n\nTurn that data into action: create and manage tracks to follow bills, set up bill and video radar rules that surface new matches automatically, and organize insights into dashboards and shareable portals. Set positions, impact, and leads on bills, assign tasks, and tag legislation for your team.\n\nWork with legislative video too—search hearings, read and export transcripts, create clips, and see which bills were discussed and when.\n\nFine-tune notifications and alerts so you and your team stay on top of the bills, committees, and calendars that matter most.\n\nRequires a paid USLege account. Access is scoped to your organization's authorized states.",
